{"seq":2,"slug":"control-flow-analysis","title":"控制流分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-optimization-codegen/ir-analysis/control-flow-analysis","wordCount":1328,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"控制流分析\">控制流分析</h1><p>IR 里的指令排成一条线，但程序真实的执行结构是一张图：分支让它分叉，跳转让它回环，循环让它反复。控制流分析（Control Flow Analysis）的任务就是从线性的指令序列里恢复出这张图，并在图上计算出支配关系、识别出循环——这些结构化信息是 SSA 构造放置 φ 函数的依据，也是循环优化能够定位「热区」的前提。它不关心数据是什么值，只关心控制权会怎么流动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>控制流分析的核心产物是控制流图（Control Flow Graph, CFG）：节点是基本块，边是块之间可能的控制转移。在此之上再计算支配关系与循环结构。下表列出本篇的几个核心对象及其用途。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本块</td>\n<td>单入口单出口的最长直线指令序列</td>\n<td>CFG 的节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制流图 CFG</td>\n<td>基本块为点、控制转移为边的有向图</td>\n<td>一切结构化分析的载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支配关系</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 支配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>：到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的每条路径都过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>循环识别、SSA 构造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支配树</td>\n<td>用直接支配者组织成的树</td>\n<td>高效查询支配关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支配边界</td>\n<td>刚脱离某块支配的块集合</td>\n<td>放置 φ 函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然循环</td>\n<td>由一条回边唯一确定的循环</td>\n<td>循环优化的工作单元</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"划分基本块\">划分基本块</h2><p>构造 CFG 的第一步是把指令流切成基本块。规则很机械：先标出所有「领导者」（leader）——函数的第一条指令、任何跳转指令的目标、以及任何跳转指令的下一条指令；然后每个领导者到下一个领导者之前的所有指令构成一个基本块。基本块的关键性质是「单入口单出口」：一旦进入就会从头执行到尾，中途没有外部跳入也没有提前跳出，所以块内的优化（见<a href=\"../optimizations/local-peephole\">局部与窥孔优化</a>）可以无视控制流地放心进行。切好块后，按每个块末尾跳转指令的目标连边，CFG 就成型了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  E[entry] --&gt; B1[&quot;B1: 初始化 i=0&quot;]&#10;  B1 --&gt; B2{&quot;B2: i &lt; n ?&quot;}&#10;  B2 --&gt;|true| B3[&quot;B3: 循环体&quot;]&#10;  B3 --&gt; B4[&quot;B4: i = i + 1&quot;]&#10;  B4 --&gt; B2&#10;  B2 --&gt;|false| B5[&quot;B5: exit&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  E[entry] --&gt; B1[\"B1: 初始化 i=0\"]\n  B1 --&gt; B2{\"B2: i &lt; n ?\"}\n  B2 --&gt;|true| B3[\"B3: 循环体\"]\n  B3 --&gt; B4[\"B4: i = i + 1\"]\n  B4 --&gt; B2\n  B2 --&gt;|false| B5[\"B5: exit\"]</pre><h2 id=\"支配关系-谁是谁的必经之路\">支配关系：谁是谁的必经之路</h2><p>在 CFG 上，我们说节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 支配节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，当且仅当从入口到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的每一条路径都必须经过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">dom</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\operatorname{dom} b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">dom</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。每个节点都支配它自己。直接支配者（immediate dominator）是除自身外、离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 最近的那个支配者，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">idom</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{idom}(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">idom</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。把每个节点连到它的直接支配者，就得到支配树——一棵能在近乎常数时间内回答「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 是否支配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>」的紧凑结构。</p>\n<p>支配集合可以用一个不动点方程刻画：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Dom</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>⋂</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">pred</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Dom</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{Dom}(b) = \\{b\\} \\cup \\left( \\bigcap_{p \\in \\operatorname{pred}(b)} \\operatorname{Dom}(p) \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Dom</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3,682,-458,1162c-21.3,163.3,-33.3,349,\n-36,557 l0,84c0.2,6,0,26,0,60c2,159.3,10,310.7,24,454c53.3,528,210,\n949.7,470,1265c4.7,6,9.7,11.7,15,17c0.7,0.7,7,1,19,1c0,0,18,0,18,0c4,-4,6,-7,6,-9\nc0,-2.7,-3.3,-8.7,-10,-18c-135.3,-192.7,-235.5,-414.3,-300.5,-665c-65,-250.7,-102.5,\n-544.7,-112.5,-882c-2,-104,-3,-167,-3,-189\nl0,-92c0,-162.7,5.7,-314,17,-454c20.7,-272,63.7,-513,129,-723c65.3,\n-210,155.3,-396.3,270,-559c6.7,-9.3,10,-15.3,10,-18z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">pred</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋂</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Dom</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M76,0c-16.7,0,-25,3,-25,9c0,2,2,6.3,6,13c21.3,28.7,42.3,60.3,\n63,95c96.7,156.7,172.8,332.5,228.5,527.5c55.7,195,92.8,416.5,111.5,664.5\nc11.3,139.3,17,290.7,17,454c0,28,1.7,43,3.3,45l0,9\nc-3,4,-3.3,16.7,-3.3,38c0,162,-5.7,313.7,-17,455c-18.7,248,-55.8,469.3,-111.5,664\nc-55.7,194.7,-131.8,370.3,-228.5,527c-20.7,34.7,-41.7,66.3,-63,95c-2,3.3,-4,7,-6,11\nc0,7.3,5.7,11,17,11c0,0,11,0,11,0c9.3,0,14.3,-0.3,15,-1c5.3,-5.3,10.3,-11,15,-17\nc242.7,-294.7,395.3,-681.7,458,-1161c21.3,-164.7,33.3,-350.7,36,-558\nl0,-144c-2,-159.3,-10,-310.7,-24,-454c-53.3,-528,-210,-949.7,\n-470,-1265c-4.7,-6,-9.7,-11.7,-15,-17c-0.7,-0.7,-6.7,-1,-18,-1z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即一个节点的支配者，是它自己加上所有前驱的支配者的交集。这个方程的求解形式与下一篇<a href=\"dataflow-analysis\">数据流分析</a>讲的不动点迭代如出一辙——支配分析本身就是数据流分析的一个特例。工程上更常用 Lengauer-Tarjan 算法，能在近线性时间内直接构造支配树，是 LLVM 等编译器的实际选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"支配边界与-放置\">支配边界与 φ 放置</h2><p>支配边界（dominance frontier）是连接控制流分析与 SSA 的关键概念。节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的支配边界是这样一批节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 支配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的某个前驱，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 并不严格支配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。直观说，它是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的支配影响力刚好消失」的那批块，也正是来自不同分支的不同变量版本可能首次汇合的地方。因此，<a href=\"intermediate-representations\">SSA 构造</a>放置 φ 函数的规则就是：把变量某个定义所在块的支配边界全部加进去，递归直到不动点。没有支配边界，就没有高效的 SSA。</p>\n<h2 id=\"识别循环\">识别循环</h2><p>程序的运行时间高度集中在循环里，所以准确识别循环至关重要。识别基于回边（back edge）：CFG 中一条边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\to h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是回边，当且仅当目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 支配源 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。每条回边唯一确定一个自然循环——由头节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 加上所有能不经过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 到达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的节点组成。头节点是循环唯一的入口，这个良好结构让循环优化得以安全地在头节点前插入「前置头块」（preheader）来安放被外提的代码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  H[&quot;循环头 h&lt;br/&gt;(被回边目标支配)&quot;] --&gt; X[&quot;循环体 a&quot;]&#10;  X --&gt; Y[&quot;循环体 b&quot;]&#10;  Y --&gt;|回边 n-&gt;h| H&#10;  H --&gt; Z[&quot;循环出口&quot;]\">graph TD\n  H[\"循环头 h&lt;br/&gt;(被回边目标支配)\"] --&gt; X[\"循环体 a\"]\n  X --&gt; Y[\"循环体 b\"]\n  Y --&gt;|回边 n-&gt;h| H\n  H --&gt; Z[\"循环出口\"]</pre><p>嵌套循环则通过支配关系组织成循环树。如何利用这些识别出的循环做外提、展开、强度削减，是<a href=\"../optimizations/loop-optimizations\">循环优化</a>的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>控制流分析从线性指令流恢复出 CFG，节点是基本块、边是控制转移，是一切结构化分析的载体。</li>\n<li>基本块通过标记「领导者」机械划分，其单入口单出口性质让<a href=\"../optimizations/local-peephole\">局部优化</a>能无视控制流地进行。</li>\n<li>支配关系刻画「必经之路」，由不动点方程定义、用 Lengauer-Tarjan 近线性构造支配树。</li>\n<li>支配边界是放置 φ 函数的依据，把控制流分析与 <a href=\"intermediate-representations\">SSA</a> 紧密绑定。</li>\n<li>回边识别出自然循环，为<a href=\"../optimizations/loop-optimizations\">循环优化</a>提供工作单元。</li>\n<li>支配集合的不动点求解形式预示了下一篇<a href=\"dataflow-analysis\">数据流分析</a>的统一框架。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"控制流分析","id":"控制流分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"划分基本块","id":"划分基本块"},{"level":2,"text":"支配关系：谁是谁的必经之路","id":"支配关系-谁是谁的必经之路"},{"level":2,"text":"支配边界与 φ 放置","id":"支配边界与-放置"},{"level":2,"text":"识别循环","id":"识别循环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"中间表示与 SSA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-optimization-codegen/ir-analysis/intermediate-representations"},"next":{"title":"数据流分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-optimization-codegen/ir-analysis/dataflow-analysis"}}